{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef90c5bc280f3243a22ab7c51e151e58189b353cf2f4bb55e09d9b9c9ce0545c", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第四幕に向けての\n稽古が進んでいる。恵美は……休憩中かな？）", "zh": "（面向《STARDOM ROAD》第四幕的排练正在进行。惠美……是在休息吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "c51259709cf07d08e562ded4ea42faea5a26dcb2bac02b569c62aaad208ac33f", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ～。ちょっと\n頼みたいことがあるんだけど、今、大丈夫？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～我有件事想拜托你，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1002_p", "source_sha256": "239402ddc2f231a1e668837e0065a3cc188e903a7a42bd24579fdc8d0feaec79", "ja": "構わないけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "没关系，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "6cade2c2d8660f8fe671cdf3e34dc043c79506e0039933198da8a76893b73fba", "ja": "アタシのこと、ナンパしてみてくれないかな？", "zh": "能不能试着搭讪我一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "cdc15b944e1d755691a7f741e947d5c1183c144d22667f8eaf76ad45e3800e8f", "ja": "あっ、ビックリさせちゃった？　ゴメンゴメン！\nちゃんと説明しないと、ワケわかんないよね。", "zh": "啊，吓到你了吗？抱歉抱歉！\n不好好说明一下的话，确实会莫名其妙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "398466a78caad3923ca2d00e7d6e3ca164fc08486bd285a1dcfa3750d2c434ca", "ja": "ほら、真珠星が湊のナンパを断るシーンがあるでしょ？\nどんな感じか、やってみたくってさ～。", "zh": "你看，不是有真珠星拒绝湊搭讪的那一幕吗？我就是想试试看那是什么感觉嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8e2dafb8d633be995bd9f38f43da15736447970532b93e2695f707c2cfd72507", "ja": "ああ、そういう事か……何かと思ったよ。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事……我还以为是什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "a0e83facec34b9e842aed9830a6b80327b5c29da76b6d403d29b437e535d20af", "ja": "読モやってた時とか、声かけられたりしたけどさ～。\nアタシと真珠星じゃ、対応も違うだろうし……。", "zh": "我以前当读者模特的时候，也有人来搭话什么的～。\n不过换成我和珍珠星，别人对待我们的方式应该也不一样吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "211c54dfc7d7beb39d4a9f139c8e935e7558b69290f370d0cd4c9f92e3d4ba26", "ja": "ちょっとコミカルなシーンみたいだし、\nいろんなパターンを練習しておきたいなって。", "zh": "看起来是稍微有点喜剧效果的场景，所以我想先练习好多种不同的模式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1010_p", "source_sha256": "11ced6cbbf9210522df3f29bbad248a1537cbb0c9fd9008b88650c57a534e88f", "ja": "うーん。フリとはいえ、アイドルにナンパの声掛け……\nなんだか気が引けるな……。", "zh": "嗯——虽然说是演练，可要对偶像搭讪……总觉得有点难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "adad164ba155f0a9add05fcdc7917e328de912c33017aa38aee1665fde51c656", "ja": "大丈夫！　{$P$}になんて言われても\nバシッと断るからさ。ね、お願いっ！", "zh": "没事的！不管{$P$}说什么，\n我都会干脆利落地拒绝你的啦。好不好，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1012_p", "source_sha256": "036586a03e848334b94308aec19d0bb7c7bae3a0c1153df8d0b90d488457d9a5", "ja": "そうか。そこまで言われたら、やるしかないな。\nそれじゃ、試しに……。", "zh": "这样啊。都被你说到这个份上了，也只能做了。\n那么，就先试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2e8ec9aebd20c6ec44ad9e57b9d60287e0df5d77ce9fe3dfb2dff12a63f540c6", "ja": "そ、そこのお姉さん、すごくカワイイね～。\nヒマだったら、一緒にカラオケでも、どうかな～？", "zh": "那、那边的小姐，你好可爱啊～  \n如果有空的话，要不要一起去唱卡拉OK什么的～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6c1d32c1ebc6c037d2bc211ad84801a94aa9a19af7b58ec8c9112e0178d6d2a", "ja": "えっ、いくいくー！\n一緒に、パーッと盛り上がっちゃお☆", "zh": "诶？去去去——！\n一起痛痛快快地嗨起来吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1015_p", "source_sha256": "70b1dacced437a1d7c5c0bb5b62d1c0b7a5c9a15346f507b66b4a8555c48f5e1", "ja": "いやいや、乗ってきちゃダメだろ！\nバシッと断るんじゃなかったのか！？", "zh": "不对不对，你怎么还跟着起劲了啊！\n不是说好要果断拒绝的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "e1174a4e5b4e87d02503e1f15724fa9e8fb572e1b98b3163e28c09c0f75c2d1c", "ja": "ハッ！？　ゴメン、相手が{$P$}だと\n思ったら、遊びたくってつい……にゃはは！", "zh": "哈！？对不起，我一想到对方是{$P$}，就忍不住想一起玩……呀哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "77b9f5d6e06c7dc9f4690a30f7b029c5c44d05fc5c712d7c441a0e535be31ba3", "ja": "次は、ちゃんとするから！\n{$P$}、もう一回お願いっ！", "zh": "下次我会好好表现的！\n{$P$}，再来一次，拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0523_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5bd9e36ab208a5c773effab0a677fedda22970be887940bc5e78eda25f80ae1c", "ja": "（恵美なりに演技の完成度をあげようと頑張っている。\n少し気恥ずかしいが、出来る限り力になってあげよう）", "zh": "（惠美正按照自己的方式努力提高演技的完成度。\n虽然有点难为情，但还是尽可能帮她一把吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
